%% Overlay paint frame sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Frame as FrameEngine facade
  participant Capture as FrameCaptureService
  participant Overlay as OverlayPreviewPlanner
  participant Runtime as Runtime view camera
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant MainPath as Main scene preview path
  participant Builder as Overlay primitive builder
  participant Painter as Overlay painter

  Surface->>Frame: paint overlay request(selectionStyle)
  Frame->>Capture: capture overlay frame once
  Capture->>Runtime: capture viewCameraOffset once for overlay frame
  Runtime-->>Capture: viewCameraRevision and viewCameraOffset
  Capture->>Preview: capture previewRevision and immutable previewState once
  Preview-->>Capture: previewRevision and immutable previewState
  Surface-->>Capture: selectionStyle for this paint frame
  Capture-->>Frame: CapturedOverlayFrame
  Note over Capture: CapturedOverlayFrame freezes previewRevision, viewCameraRevision, viewCameraOffset, immutable previewState, and selectionStyle for this paint frame.

  Frame->>Overlay: admit overlay preview variant from captured CanvasPreviewState only

  alt preview is CanvasMarqueePreview
    Overlay->>Builder: build marquee fill and stroke primitive
  else preview is CanvasPencilStrokePreview or CanvasMarkerStrokePreview
    Overlay->>Builder: build stroke preview primitive from CanvasStrokePreview facts
  else preview is CanvasPendingLineStartPreview
    Overlay->>Builder: build pending line start primitive
  else preview is CanvasLinePreview
    Overlay->>Builder: build line preview primitive
  else preview is CanvasEraserPreview
    Overlay->>Builder: build eraser corridor primitive
  else preview is CanvasSelectedMovePreview
    Overlay-->>MainPath: reject selected move from overlay admission
    Note over MainPath: Selected move preview is rendered by the main scene selected supplement path, never by overlay paint.
  else no overlay preview
    Overlay->>Builder: build empty overlay primitive list
  end

  Builder-->>Overlay: immutable overlay primitives
  Overlay-->>Frame: immutable overlay primitives
  Note over Builder,Overlay: Primitive construction uses captured viewCameraOffset, previewState, and selectionStyle only.
  Frame->>Painter: paint captured overlay frame and immutable primitives
  Painter-->>Surface: draw overlay UI

  Note over Painter: Overlay painter consumes captured frame facts and immutable primitives only. It performs no live runtime reads.
  Note over Painter,Runtime: Forbidden: painter reads from DocumentStoreKernel, InteractionEngine, FrameEngine runtime state, or public document projection.
  Note over Frame,Runtime: Forbidden in overlay paint: CanvasDocument materialization, DocumentProjectionCache reads, Store mutation, cache invalidation, repaint scheduling, and action events.
  Note over Surface,Painter: Forbidden: resource resolver reads and selected move rendering in overlay paint.
